# Enchantment Descriptions (Enchantment Descriptions Mod & JEI Information Pages)
enchantment.divineenchantments.gravitational.desc=Arrows create a gravitational anomaly upon landing, pulling all entities within a 5-block radius 2 blocks toward the impact point. Treasure enchantment (cannot be obtained from the enchanting table).
enchantment.divineenchantments.chainsaw.desc=Direct melee hits cause the target to bleed, taking (4 + level) percent weapon damage every 0.3 seconds for (3 + level) ticks. Bleeds bypass target invulnerability frames and produce bleeding particles.
enchantment.divineenchantments.pierceful.desc=Arrows pass through up to (level) entities, damaging each in their path before landing on their final target or surface. Triggers Gravitational on final impact. Incompatible with Rune: Arrow Piercing and Longdraw. Treasure enchantment (cannot be obtained from the enchanting table).
enchantment.divineenchantments.ally.desc=Grants a 2 percent chance on hit to summon an ephemeral friendly Aegis minion that fights alongside the player in Assist mode for 60 seconds. Maximum 4 living Aegis per player. Incompatible with Voodoo. Requires Lycanites Mobs.
enchantment.divineenchantments.sacrificial.desc=While held in the main hand, grants +10 percent attack damage, +10 percent attack speed, and +10 percent movement speed in exchange for -10 percent maximum health and -10 percent armor.
enchantment.divineenchantments.heavyplated.desc=Increases armor rating by +8 percent per piece worn, at the cost of -3 percent movement speed per piece.
enchantment.divineenchantments.autofire.desc=Fires 1 (Level I) or 2 (Level II) trailing arrows with matched velocity. Every arrow in the volley deals 60 percent damage. Bypasses target invulnerability frames so all arrows can land. Fully compatible with Multishot. Super rare treasure enchantment (cannot be obtained from the enchanting table).
enchantment.divineenchantments.webber.desc=Swords instantly slice through cobwebs with zero delay. Melee attacks have a (0.4 * level) percent chance to ensnare the target in a cobweb and play a spider sound. Treasure enchantment (cannot be obtained from the enchanting table).
enchantment.divineenchantments.headhunter.desc=Arrows striking an entity's head or upper hitbox deal 1.5x critical damage with special sound and particle effects. Incompatible with Mending, Advanced Mending, and Infinity. Treasure enchantment (cannot be obtained from the enchanting table).
enchantment.divineenchantments.riches.desc=Slain mobs have a 10 percent (Level I) or 20 percent (Level II) chance to trigger a 10x loot and boosted XP explosion. Bosses and boss-bar mobs are immune. Adept increases the chance and XP payout. Incompatible with Education. Stacks with Looting and Advanced Looting.
enchantment.divineenchantments.slowsink.desc=Slows your sinking speed in water like a falling feather, allowing controlled underwater descent. Sneak to sink at normal speed.
enchantment.divineenchantments.apex.desc=Deals +2 percent bonus damage per block above your target, capped at +25 percent, and takes +2 percent extra damage per block below attackers, capped at +25 percent. Treasure enchantment (cannot be obtained from the enchanting table).
enchantment.divineenchantments.royal_guard.desc=When taking damage, redirects (10 * level) percent of durability damage dealt to worn armor onto the durability of the held weapon or tool instead. Cannot be applied to bows. Treasure enchantment (cannot be obtained from the enchanting table).
enchantment.divineenchantments.curse_of_the_tether.desc=Grants 10 percent damage resistance against all attacks and reduces durability damage to the chestplate by 20 percent, but the chestplate becomes permanently tethered to your body and cannot be removed in Survival mode. Removal attempts are rejected and duplicate cursor or container copies are purged.
enchantment.divineenchantments.curse_of_inertia.desc=Continuous sprinting ramps up movement speed linearly up to +80 percent over 5 seconds. However, turning radius is severely restricted, and stopping incurs 1.5 seconds of slippery sliding deceleration across all surfaces.

enchantment.divineenchantments.aperture.desc=Only works while actively blocking. Captures incoming enemy projectiles (arrows, bolts, dragon breath orbs, cacodemon balls, Reaper spectral bolts) on your shield, fully transfers ownership to you including SRG thrower fields, and re-fires them from your eye height along your look vector with +50 percent boosted speed as allied projectiles that can damage their original owner. Treasure enchantment (cannot be obtained from the enchanting table).
enchantment.divineenchantments.gyroscopic_plating.desc=While sneaking, temporarily suppresses Nausea, Lycanites Instability, Potion Core Spin, Perplexity, and Inversion without touching the camera. Suppressed effects return when you stop sneaking. Tapping Crouch right before landing from a fall of over 4 blocks converts 100 percent of vertical fall momentum into forward sprint velocity, completely negating fall damage. Treasure enchantment (cannot be obtained from the enchanting table).
enchantment.divineenchantments.slip_bore.desc=Arrows punch a low-pressure vacuum tunnel through the air (3-block radius), dragging all nearby mobs inward toward the flight path, crashing flying mobs to the ground, and pulling ground mobs into a tight line behind the arrow. Applicable to bows and crossbows. Incompatible with Multishot and Splitshot.
enchantment.divineenchantments.harmonic_anchor.desc=Hooking a mob drops a spectral anchor stone at their feet. For 8 seconds, the mob cannot move more than 5 blocks from the anchor point; any attempt to charge, fly, or leap away pulls the line taut, slingshotting them backward to the anchor center. Bosses, boss-bar mobs, and mobs above 150 HP are immune. Treasure enchantment (cannot be obtained from the enchanting table).
enchantment.divineenchantments.perpetual_crucible.desc=Landing critical hits or killing a mob grants Potion Core Extension I/II/III for 3/4.5/6 seconds, freezing active potion buff timers from ticking down as long as you remain aggressively engaged in combat. Treasure enchantment (cannot be obtained from the enchanting table).
enchantment.divineenchantments.gamblers_gambit.desc=Melee hits have a 25 percent chance to inflict a random negative potion effect on the target, selected from vanilla, Potion Core, and any other installed mod. Bosses and boss-bar mobs are immune.
enchantment.divineenchantments.grounded_vanguard.desc=Sneaking grants Solid Core (cancels knockback) and Weight III (heavy downward gravity), preventing flying mobs from lifting, carrying, or displacing you. Releasing sneak smoothly purges the effect without fall damage.
enchantment.divineenchantments.curse_of_the_volatile_soul.desc=When suffering fatal damage, the chestplate acts as a Totem of Undying, consuming itself and triggering a colossal power 20 explosion that completely ruins surrounding terrain and obliterates enemies while leaving you unharmed. Treasure enchantment (cannot be obtained from the enchanting table).

enchantment.divineenchantments.breach.desc=Melee attacks have a (20 * level) percent chance to afflict the target with Vulnerability for 15 seconds, and a (15 * level) percent chance to inflict 10x durability damage to the victim's armor.
enchantment.divineenchantments.demonic_edge.desc=Deals +2.5 bonus damage per level against any mob that naturally spawns in the Nether, including modded Nether biome spawns and structure mobs, plus Lycanites Mobs demon and shadow creatures. Mutually exclusive with Sharpness, Smite, and Bane of Arthropods.
enchantment.divineenchantments.necrotic_stasis.desc=Melee strikes afflict the target with Decay for 10 seconds. At Level II, also completely strips and purges Regeneration and Absorption effects and shields from the target.
enchantment.divineenchantments.volatile_discharge.desc=Melee attacks charge the target by (3 * level) percent per strike. Upon reaching 100 percent charge or higher, the enemy violently detonates in a power 5 explosion, larger than a creeper.
enchantment.divineenchantments.muzzle.desc=Fired crossbow bolts and arrows afflict targets with Aphagia for 10 seconds, disabling item usage and consumption. Works with Spartan iron, diamond, tipped, and spectral bolts. Very rare crossbow enchantment from the enchanting table (table level 30).
enchantment.divineenchantments.archery.desc=Killing an enemy with your bow grants Trueshot I for 10 seconds. At Level II, killing 4 enemies within those 10 seconds upgrades to Trueshot II. At Level III, killing 10 enemies within those 10 seconds upgrades to Trueshot III. Table levels: I at 8, II at 19, III at 30.
enchantment.divineenchantments.arachnid_ascent.desc=Grants the Climbing effect while wearing leggings, allowing you to walk directly up solid vertical surfaces like a spider. Treasure enchantment (cannot be obtained from the enchanting table).

enchantment.divineenchantments.umbral_prowess.desc=In deep darkness (light level 4 or below), the wearer gains innate night vision, +20 percent movement speed, and +20 percent bonus physical damage. Stepping into full daylight (light level 12+) inflicts a minor slowness debuff. Treasure enchantment (cannot be obtained from the enchanting table).
enchantment.divineenchantments.gourmands_vitality.desc=Eating any food item grants an emergency surge of health regeneration (3 * level seconds), resistance (5 * level seconds), and absorption (10 * level seconds) proportional to the food's hunger and saturation value. Mutually exclusive with Strengthened Vitality.
enchantment.divineenchantments.ballistic_overdrive.desc=Loaded crossbow projectiles ignore gravity completely, travelling in a pure laser-straight line with infinite punch-through piercing on non-boss entities until colliding with solid terrain or a boss monster. Works with Spartan bolts by resetting vertical motion every tick. Mutually exclusive with Rapid Load and Strafe.
enchantment.divineenchantments.curse_debt_of_the_void.desc=Prevents the item from ever losing durability. In exchange, every point of durability damage the item would have taken is converted directly into hunger depletion and minor true damage dealt to the wearer.
enchantment.divineenchantments.curse_berserkers_bloodlust.desc=Base attack damage scales up to +150 percent higher as your health drops toward death. In exchange, all healing received is reduced by 75 percent, including natural regeneration, potions, lifesteal, and direct health restoration.
enchantment.divineenchantments.splintering_impact.desc=Crossbow arrows striking a solid block shatter into a radial burst of 4, 9, or 13 independent shrapnel arrows that fly outward in all directions. Each shard uses half of the original bolt's base damage, so Power and Advanced Power scale the shrapnel.
enchantment.divineenchantments.headslicer.desc=Airborne melee attacks deal +15 percent (Level I), +30 percent (Level II), or +50 percent (Level III) bonus damage while you are not on the ground, including jumps and falls.
enchantment.divineenchantments.longdraw.desc=Allows bows to be drawn past 100 percent up to 250 percent power (50 ticks). Overdrawing creates a concussive muzzle blast, pierces up to 5 targets with scaled damage, and recoils the archer backward 6 blocks. Incompatible with Mending, Strafe, Multishot, Splitshot, Rapid Fire, Range, and Pierceful. Treasure enchantment (cannot be obtained from the enchanting table).
enchantment.divineenchantments.suregrip.desc=Prevents your held weapon or tool from being knocked out or stolen by Infernal Mobs Sticky/Thieving affixes and other disarm abilities. However, the tight grip prevents dual-wielding, forcing offhand items to drop. Treasure enchantment (cannot be obtained from the enchanting table).
enchantment.divineenchantments.cushioned_heel.desc=Dampens kinetic wall-impact collision damage and minor fall damage (4.5 blocks or less) by 30 percent.
enchantment.divineenchantments.mudstrider.desc=Removes movement speed penalties from Soul Sand, modded mud/silt blocks, Cobwebs, and shallow water. END-tick correction keeps movement synchronized between client and server.
enchantment.divineenchantments.culling.desc=Axe and dagger attacks deal +25 percent bonus damage exclusively against targets below 25 percent of their maximum health.
enchantment.divineenchantments.dulled_impact.desc=Blunt weapon and hammer attacks daze the target, reducing their outgoing attack damage by 10 percent / 20 percent / 30 percent for 5 seconds. Does not stack.
enchantment.divineenchantments.glimmer.desc=Fired arrows and bolts leave a faint shimmering particle trail and mark struck targets with the Glowing status effect for 5 seconds without bonus damage.
enchantment.divineenchantments.braced_pivot.desc=Reinforces shield posture, cutting the base 100-tick shield-disable cooldown by 60 percent (to 40 ticks).

enchantment.divineenchantments.feathered_draw.desc=Removes 20 percent / 40 percent / 60 percent / 80 percent of the bow draw slowdown at levels I-IV, leaving -64 percent / -48 percent / -32 percent / -16 percent movement speed while aiming. The speed modifier is removed immediately when you stop charging or swap items. Incompatible with Strafe.
enchantment.divineenchantments.stagger.desc=Fully charged melee hits have a 65 percent chance to interrupt a basic mob's attack windup and inflict Lycanites Paralysis for 3 seconds, or 1 second if the target wears a helmet. Bosses and champions are immune.
enchantment.divineenchantments.puncture.desc=Piercing strikes bypass 10 percent of natural mob armor.
enchantment.divineenchantments.tempered_core.desc=Eliminates the extra durability penalty for using the wrong tool on a block or mob (e.g. hitting mobs with a pickaxe or breaking cobwebs with a sword only consumes 1 durability instead of 2).
enchantment.divineenchantments.thermal_foil.desc=Slows down the rate at which your body temperature changes in Tough As Nails or Simple Difficulty by 20 percent per piece worn.
enchantment.divineenchantments.machine_bow.desc=When charging the bow reaches full power, it fires automatically with slight recoil and spread, immediately re-drawing for continuous rapid-fire bursts. Draw times are 20/16/13/10 ticks at levels I-IV. Higher levels also reduce recoil and spread. Incompatible with Multishot, Rapid Fire, Strafe, and Infinity.
enchantment.divineenchantments.desalination_mesh.desc=Immediately suppresses Parasites and Thirsty effects from dirty or salt water (Tough As Nails / Simple Difficulty) while the helmet is worn.
enchantment.divineenchantments.metabolic_slumber.desc=Pauses hunger and thirst depletion while idle and stationary, taking effect after 10 seconds of resting.
enchantment.divineenchantments.sober_chisel.desc=Reduces the chance of triggering aggressive ore-spawn entities (like Lycanites Geonachs from coal/iron or Tremors from stone) by 75 percent, at the cost of -5 percent mining speed.
enchantment.divineenchantments.shimmered.desc=Breaking an ore block draws a glowing through-wall box outline around identical ore blocks within 2 blocks for 1 second.
enchantment.divineenchantments.silt_sifter.desc=Digging natural gravel, clay, sand, or dirt has a 5 percent chance to yield minor foraging bits (flint, stray string, clay balls, or iron nuggets).
enchantment.divineenchantments.dampening_strike.desc=Mining blocks produces 70 percent less vibration and acoustic sound radius. Integrates with Dynamic Surroundings and sound-based mob targeting, preventing distant mobs from locking onto you through cave walls.
enchantment.divineenchantments.cushioned_shirt.desc=Dampens horizontal kinetic impact damage by 60 percent when colliding with terrain while flying, grappling, or riding at high speed. Directly supports CollisionDamage and similar kinetic damage sources.
enchantment.divineenchantments.magnetic_clasp.desc=Attracts ground items within 3 blocks (6 blocks if worn on both boots and chestplate), but only if that exact item already exists in your inventory in an incomplete stack.
enchantment.divineenchantments.ground_sweep.desc=Restores vanilla walk-over collision pickup, automatically collecting items you walk over without requiring manual right-clicking or aiming. Super rare treasure enchantment (cannot be obtained from the enchanting table).

enchantment.divineenchantments.shadow_stalker.desc=Reduces the detection radius of unaware, sleeping, or idle mobs by (25 * level) percent while sneaking. Breaks upon sprinting, attacking, or entering direct line-of-sight within 6 blocks.
enchantment.divineenchantments.challengers_mark.desc=Performing a shield bash forces the target to lock onto you for (3 * level) seconds, breaking their target lock on passive pets, tamed mounts, or party members. Has a 6-second cooldown per target.
enchantment.divineenchantments.gargoyle_stance.desc=Eliminates involuntary displacement from external suction and vacuum effects (such as Lycanites Djinn vortexes, underwater whirlpools, or siren pulls) as long as both feet remain firmly on solid blocks.
enchantment.divineenchantments.quiet_chipping.desc=Reduces mining block break volume by 75 percent and cuts the acoustic vibration range by 75 percent. Works with axes, pickaxes, and hammers, plus Dynamic Surroundings and sound-based mob targeting.
enchantment.divineenchantments.salvage_line.desc=Catching non-fish junk items (boots, rusted tools, string, bones) automatically breaks them down into bonus experience points and useful repair materials (nuggets, leather, string).

enchantment.divineenchantments.rune_carnage.desc=Fully charged hits grant immediate additive attack speed (+0.1 per level) plus +0.0524 per stack, stacking up to 7 * level times. At level III with 21 stacks this totals +1.4 attack speed, matching Swifter Slashes VII. Enemy invulnerability frames are set to your weapon's recharge time, so they expire when the attack indicator is full again. Stacks decay by 5 every 5 seconds without a hit. Nunchaku, sabers, and rapiers only. Incompatible with Swifter Slashes. Very rare enchanting table enchantment (table level 24-30; tier III unlocks at 30).
enchantment.divineenchantments.enlargement.desc=Melee hits have a (2 * level) percent chance to apply Enlargement for 20 seconds, increasing the target's size and hitbox by (10 * level) percent, capped at 30 percent. Bosses and mobs above 150 HP receive half duration.
enchantment.divineenchantments.bullseye.desc=Each arrow hit has a (25 * level) percent chance to place a bullseye on the enemy for 3 seconds. Level IV always places it. Any arrow hit on a marked enemy deals an additional (20 * level) percent damage, no matter where on the hitbox it lands. Further hits refresh the marker.
enchantment.divineenchantments.hunter.desc=Arrows make the struck enemy glow for (20 * level * draw) seconds, where draw is the bow's charge at release (0.0 to 1.0). A fully drawn bow at level III marks the target for 60 seconds.
enchantment.divineenchantments.voodoo.desc=Slaying an enemy has a (2 * level) percent chance to raise a loyal zombie ally from the ground at their corpse for (30 * level) seconds. The ally has (4 * level) health, moves 35 percent faster than a zombie, deals (3 + level) damage, follows you across dimensions, prioritizes visible enemies near you, cannot pick up items or armor, and cannot be harmed by its owner. Maximum 6 living allies per player. Incompatible with Ally. Treasure enchantment (cannot be obtained from the enchanting table).
enchantment.divineenchantments.kratos_blades.desc=While held, forces the other hand to drop its item and manifests a duplicate of the blade there. Right-clicking hurls a fishing-hook chain that pulls the first mob or player it touches toward you, consuming 1 durability. Sabers only. Treasure enchantment (cannot be obtained from the enchanting table).

